{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":19.44},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.04,"end":38.64},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.64,"end":55.04}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":5.12,"text":"軌道在加入連接調整前使用 y = ax²/3，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.493,"end":9.36,"text":"因此切線斜率為 2ax/3。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":11.68,"text":"增加彎曲係數，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.76,"end":14.16,"text":"同時改變形狀與局部方向。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.72,"end":17.92,"text":"因此可以在指定位置設定目標斜率，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18,"end":19.44,"text":"反過來調整軌道。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.04,"end":23.6,"text":"在 x = 1 比較彎曲係數 0."},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.92,"end":24.64,"text":"5 和 1。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.92,"end":28.8,"text":"先預測係數加倍如何影響切線，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.04,"end":30.64,"text":"再看即時讀值。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.16,"end":33.76,"text":"這段軌道彎曲係數 0."},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":34.08,"end":35.92,"text":"5、連接值 0 時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":36.2,"end":38.64,"text":"在 x = 1 的斜率是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.64,"end":42.24,"text":"這段軌道彎曲係數 0."},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.56,"end":44.48,"text":"5、連接值 0 時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.8,"end":47.28,"text":"在 x = 1 的斜率是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.8,"end":52.16,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":52.72,"end":55.04,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}